    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That is definitely much more intense and captures that visceral quality I was looking for. It really highlights the dehumanization they used to justify their actions. To round out this scene, I want to show the recruit's reaction. Could you write a brief follow-up where the older man doubles down on the idea that this isn't just about \"control,\" but that it's a biological necessity for the survival of their race? Just to really hammer home the pseudo-scientific aspect they believed in back then.",
